 "just now": "justo ahora",
 "Just saying hello": "Solo para saludar",
 "Just woken": "Acaba de despertar",
 "Keep life support and communications.": "Mantenga el soporte vital y las comunicaciones.",
 "Keep the countermeasures going": "Mantenga las contramedidas",
